UFpMm96QkxHQ0ZLSEJFNVdTb3dBM3VsMDFSYlozWGtYZWpNWUlqU2NYeDRXNGc1MTFIUVc4dGQ2NUU1NHdIbl9FNjJtczBaWGl4SGVRaFJvOHVBbm9Rbm5Ic2U5ZTEwemVnR0phQm53eFlXRHRPNDBtQ0Z4cw?oc=5","date":"2026-10-28","zh":"3 個具有穩定租金支票和截然不同股息風險的自助式房地產投資信託基金"},{"title":"Can Public Storage (NYSE:PSA) Strengthen Its Position in Real Estate?","src":"Kalkine Media","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiywFBVV95cUxQbWxQRzFVXzJUSFhpSzhfZUxWWXJ5M25pSi01Sy0yNVlvNTBVZmk3V0ZuckI2clAtV0FjRWhERk1HMmtxalhvOEpzcjh3SnA5RkN1eC1oSjlNNlpLVm14V2xWeTdTZmJLaDhOVWpWMm9TQUJPRUVYWHdLU1BtMUw2UnZmTVVnSEZNVXVsVGRuNTVlQnRrR2dJZmptR2xRNXBFVUhVUDhlQk85WUdzQUM2MzhSRXFkeGRFX3JuSWpWVlRuWWRUclljTG1MTQ?oc=5","date":"2026-10-28","zh":"公共儲存（NYSE：PSA）能否鞏固其在房地產領域的地位？"}],"themes":[{"name":"財報","count":5},{"name":"AI 人工智慧","count":1},{"name":"股票回購/股利","count":1},{"name":"分析師評等","count":1}],"biz":{"tenk":{"form":"10-K","date":"2026-02-12","period":"2025-12-31","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1393311/000162828026007696/psa-20251231.htm"},"overview":[{"en":"Public Storage is a Maryland real estate investment trust (\"REIT\") engaged in the ownership, development, and operation of self-storage facilities and other related operations including tenant reinsurance, third-party self-storage management and bridge lending to third-party self-storage owners. We are the industry leading owner of self-storage properties, with one of the most recognized brands in the self-storage industry, including our ubiquitous orange color.","zh":"Public Storage 是馬裡蘭州房地產投資信託基金（「REIT」），從事自助倉儲設施的所有權、開發和營運以及其他相關業務，包括租戶再保險、第三方自助倉儲管理以及向第三方自助倉儲所有者提供過橋貸款。我们是自助仓储行业的领先所有者，拥有自助仓储行业最受认可的品牌之一，包括我们无处不在的橙色。"},{"en":"On August 14, 2023, we completed a reorganization that resulted in us holding the interests in our facilities through an operating partnership, Public Storage OP, L.P. and its subsidiaries including Public Storage Operating Company, formerly known as Public Storage, which was organized in 1980. This structure is commonly referred to as an umbrella partnership REIT, or UPREIT. After the reorganization, the primary assets of the parent entity, Public Storage, are general partner and limited partner interests in Public Storage OP, L.P.","zh":"2023 年 8 月 14 日，我們完成了重組，透過營運合夥企業 Public Storage OP, L.P. 及其子公司（包括成立於 1980 年的 Public Storage Operating Company，前身為 Public Storage）持有我們設施的權益。这种结构通常称为伞式合伙 REIT 或 UPREIT。重组后，母公司 Public Storage 的主要资产是 Public Storage OP, L.P. 的普通合伙人和有限合伙人权益。"},{"en":"Unless stated otherwise or the context otherwise requires, references to \"Public Storage\" mean the parent entity, Public Storage, references to \"PSA OP\" mean Public Storage OP, L.P., and references to \"PSOC\" mean Public Storage Operating Company. References to \"the Company,\" \"we,\" \"us,\" and \"our\" mean collectively Public Storage, PSA OP, PSOC and those entities/subsidiaries owned or controlled by Public Storage, PSA OP, and PSOC.","zh":"除非另有說明或上下文另有要求，否則提及的「公共存儲」指的是母公司公共存儲，提及的「PSA OP」指的是公共存儲 OP, L.P.，提及的「PSOC」指的是公共存儲運營公司。提及的「本公司」、「我們」和「我們的」統指 Public Storage、PSA OP、PSOC 以及 Public Storage、PSA OP 和 PSOC 擁有或控制的實體/子公司。"}],"markets":[],"customers":[{"en":"Ownership and operation of self-storage facilities is highly fragmented. As the largest owner of self-storage facilities, we believe that we own approximately 9% of the self-storage square footage in the U.S. and that collectively the four largest self-storage owners in the U.S. own approximately 22%, with the remaining 78% owned by regional and local operators. We believe our Public Storage brand awareness, as well as the innovative improvements we have made to the customer experience described below, provide us with a competitive advantage in acquiring and retaining customers relative to other self-storage operators.","zh":"自助倉儲設施的所有權和營運高度分散。作為最大的自助倉儲設施所有者，我們相信我們擁有美國約 9% 的自助倉儲面積，而美國四大自助倉儲所有者總共擁有約 22% 的份額，其餘 78% 由區域和本地運營商擁有。我們相信，我們的公共儲存品牌知名度，以及我們對下述客戶體驗所做的創新改進，為我們提供了相對於其他自助倉儲業者在獲取和留住客戶方面的競爭優勢。"}],"competition":[{"en":"Ownership and operation of self-storage facilities is highly fragmented. As the largest owner of self-storage facilities, we believe that we own approximately 9% of the self-storage square footage in the U.S. and that collectively the four largest self-storage owners in the U.S. own approximately 22%, with the remaining 78% owned by regional and local operators. We believe our Public Storage brand awareness, as well as the innovative improvements we have made to the customer experience described below, provide us with a competitive advantage in acquiring and retaining customers relative to other self-storage operators.","zh":"自助倉儲設施的所有權和營運高度分散。作為最大的自助倉儲設施所有者，我們相信我們擁有美國約 9% 的自助倉儲面積，而美國四大自助倉儲所有者總共擁有約 22% 的份額，其餘 78% 由區域和本地運營商擁有。我們相信，我們的公共儲存品牌知名度，以及我們對下述客戶體驗所做的創新改進，為我們提供了相對於其他自助倉儲業者在獲取和留住客戶方面的競爭優勢。"},{"en":"Our facilities compete with nearby self-storage facilities owned by other operators, who use marketing channels, including internet advertising, signage, and banners, and offer services similar to ours. As a result, competition may be significant and can affect the occupancy levels, rental rates, rental income, and operating expenses of our facilities. However, we believe that the economies of scale inherent in this business allow us to operate self-storage facilities at a materially higher level of cash flow per square foot than other operators without our scale.","zh":"我們的設施與附近其他業者擁有的自助倉儲設施競爭，這些設施使用行銷管道，包括網路廣告、標牌和橫幅，並提供與我們類似的服務。因此，竞争可能会很激烈，并可能影响我们设施的入住率、租金率、租金收入和运营费用。然而，我們相信，這項業務固有的規模經濟使我們能夠以比其他沒有我們規模的營運商更高的每平方英尺現金流水平運營自助倉儲設施。"}],"segments":{"seg":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"Self Storage Operations","val":4489413000,"zh":"自存儲操作"},{"name":"Ancillary Operations","val":334700000,"zh":"輔助業務"}],"total":4824113000},"prod":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"Self Storage Operations","val":4489413000,"zh":"自存儲操作"},{"name":"Ancillary Operations","val":334700000,"zh":"輔助業務"}],"total":4824113000}},"peers":["EXR","PLD","VMRK","BXP","ESS"]}}